      "title": "半正定矩阵及其半正定平方根",
      "stem": "设\n$$A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&-1&0&1\\\\-1&2&1&0\\\\0&1&2&-1\\\\1&0&-1&2\\end{pmatrix}.$$\n证明 $A$ 为半正定矩阵，并求半正定矩阵 $B$，使得 $B^2=A$。",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 3,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$A$ 的特征值为 $0,2,2,4$，故 $A\\succeq0$。其唯一半正定平方根为\n$$B=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+\\sqrt2&-1&\\sqrt2-1&1\\\\-1&1+\\sqrt2&1&\\sqrt2-1\\\\\\sqrt2-1&1&1+\\sqrt2&-1\\\\1&\\sqrt2-1&-1&1+\\sqrt2\\end{pmatrix}.$$",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "谱分解构造半正定平方根",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "可取两两正交的特征向量 $v_0=(-1,-1,1,1)^T$、$u_1=(1,0,1,0)^T$、$u_2=(0,1,0,1)^T$、$v_4=(1,-1,-1,1)^T$，对应特征值分别为 $0,2,2,4$。所有特征值非负，故 $A$ 半正定。令 $P_w=ww^T/(w^Tw)$，则半正定平方根为 $B=\\sqrt2(P_{u_1}+P_{u_2})+2P_{v_4}$。展开投影矩阵即可得到显式答案；其谱为 $0,\\sqrt2,\\sqrt2,2$，所以 $B\\succeq0$ 且 $B^2=A$。",
          "main_method_code": "spectral_function_construction",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "求得 $A$ 的特征值 $0,2,2,4$ 及一组正交特征向量。",
              "method_code": "orthogonal_diagonalization"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "实对称矩阵的特征值均非负，因此 $A$ 半正定。",
              "knowledge_point_code": "positive_semidefinite_matrix"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "在各特征子空间上把特征值 $\\lambda$ 替换为 $\\sqrt\\lambda$，构造 $B$。",
              "method_code": "spectral_function_construction"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "展开三个正交投影，得到 $B$ 的显式矩阵。"
            },
            {
              "order": 5,
              "role": "check",
              "text": "$B$ 的特征值非负，且平方后的谱与 $A$ 相同，故 $B\\succeq0$ 且 $B^2=A$。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
